Final limit: control median 3.0 (range 1-7), newcomer median 8.0 (range 4-10) (exact Mann-Whitney p = 0.0242)
Compliance: surviving 80.6% (n=11), collapsed 88.2% (n=11) (U = 36.5, two-sided p = 0.1214)

